        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin Estates Collection 5121 Lever With 5019 Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe stunning beauty of Baldwin 5121 Lever with 5019 Rosette is most pronounced in the attention to detail. Every inch of this leverset is dripping with ornate splendor; and yet this elaborately decorated lever and rose set is not gaudy in its appearance. In fact, the unique shape is almost angelic in appearance, with a featheriness that is so often lost on other, heavier looking, ornate pieces. This is leverset will fit 1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\" door thicknesses with an optional backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\".\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin 5121 Ornate Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Accessibility Code (ADA) A117.1</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Concealed mounting to hide unsightly installation screws.</li>\r\n<li>Forged from solid brass for maximum strength and durability.</li>\r\n<li>28 degree latch rotation</li>\r\n<li>Heavy duty latch bolts springs.</li>\r\n<li>Latches are reversible for all door conditions.</li>\r\n<li>Latches include standard full lip strike.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Solid Brass Ornate Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>5019 Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: choose either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim. </li>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two levers.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button located on rosette. An emergency release function allows the lever to automatically unlock when it is turned from the inside.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe <b>Half Dummy function is handed.</b> <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Handing</b></a>. All other lever functions are non-handed.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Ornate Solid Brass Leverset, Baldwin 5121",
                "description": "Baldwin Estate Collection 5121 Lever with 5018 Rosette - The stunning beauty of the Baldwin 5121 Lever with the 5018 Rose is most pronounced in the attention to detail. Every inch of this leverset is dripping with ornate splendor; and yet, this elaborately decorated lever and rosette is not gaudy in its appearance. In fact, the unique shape is almost angelic in appearance, with a featheriness that is so often lost on other, heavier looking, ornate pieces. This everset will fit 1-3/8 inch and 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses with an optional backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
                "keywords": "BAL-5121, Baldwin ornate leversets, baldwin 5121 levers, baldwin 5121 roses, baldwin 5018 roses, solid brass leversets, ornate levers, ornate levesets, baldwin 5121 leversets, baldwin 5018 rosettes, baldwin estates collections, ada compliant levers"
